<div class="text parbase section">
<h3 style="text-align: center;">
  <b>How Do I Become a Candidate?</b></h3>
 <p>Here are the necessary steps potential candidates need to become a
  qualified candidate. This information applies only for offices managed
  by the San Diego County Registrar of Voters. For City offices, please
  contact the respective <a href="/content/dam/rov/shared/candidate-filing/city-clerks.pdf" target="_self">City Clerk.</a></p>
 <p>
  <b>In-person Services Provided</b>
  <br /> </p>
 <p>We are available Monday through Friday from 8 a.m. to 5 p.m. by
  phone <a href="tel:8585057260">(858) 505-7260</a> or email <a href="mailto:CandidateFiling@sdcounty.ca.gov">CandidateFiling@sdcounty.ca.gov</a>.<br /> </p>
 <p>Documents may only be picked up by the candidate, or by the person
  authorized by the candidate. The form needed to authorize someone to
  pick up the candidate’s documents is available prior to the next
  election. To make an appointment, call <a href="tel:8585057260">(858)
  505-7260</a> or email <a href="mailto:CandidateFiling@sdcounty.ca.gov">CandidateFiling@sdcounty.ca.gov</a>.</p>
 <p>
  <a href="/content/rov/en/elec-rep-info-lookup.html">Verify the
    district you live in.</a></p>

</div>
<div class="text parbase section">
<hr style="height: 2.0px;border: none;background-color: rgb(204,204,204);" />

</div>
<div class="text parbase section">
